---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-24 border-t border-gilt/25">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 gap-8 px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-4">
    <div class="md:col-span-2">
      <p class="font-display text-2xl italic">Rooted in tradition, grown with care.</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-parchment-dim">
        Small-batch herbal teas, tinctures and salves, and one-on-one consultations.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm">
        <a href="mailto:hello@thedivinevine.org">hello@thedivinevine.org</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h4 class="eyebrow">Explore</h4>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/shop">Shop all</a></li>
        <li><a href="/booking">Book a consultation</a></li>
        <li><a href="/journal">Journal</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h4 class="eyebrow">Policies</h4>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/legal/health-disclaimer">Health disclaimer</a></li>
        <li><a href="/legal/shipping">Shipping &amp; returns</a></li>
        <li><a href="/legal/terms">Terms</a></li>
        <li><a href="/legal/privacy">Privacy</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-gilt/15">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-4 text-xs text-parchment-dim sm:px-6">
      <p>
        These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. Our products are not
        intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2">&copy; {year} The Divine Vine</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
